From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 03:04:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] libstore: enforce derivation no-progress deadlines

Track each local builder process tree CPU, I/O, and build-log metadata. Wake
the daemon worker once per second while the policy is active and deliver the
existing timeout event only when every progress signal remains unchanged for
the configured deadline. Derivations requiring big-parallel receive their
separate deadline.

Also exercise client disconnect against a live daemon build so canceling the
client cannot leave daemon-owned compute running.
